        "details": "<p><strong>Srujana Hackathon&nbsp; Batch 2</strong></p>\n<p><strong>About the Hackathon</strong></p>\n<p>Srujana Hackathon Series 2026 &ndash; Batch 2 is an innovation-driven initiative designed to bring together students, aspiring developers, and creative problem-solvers to explore real-world challenges and develop impactful solutions.</p>\n<p>Organized at <strong>Biorad Medisys, Prabhavee Tech Park, Pune</strong>, the event will introduce participants to the Srujana initiative, provide insights into Ethosh&rsquo;s projects and Biorad&rsquo;s AI initiatives, and present problem statements that encourage innovative thinking and practical problem-solving.</p>\n<p>Participants will gain an understanding of the challenges, proposed solution expectations, and judging criteria before beginning their ideation and development journey. The event offers an opportunity to learn, collaborate, think creatively, and explore how technology can address real-world problems.</p>\n<p>Whether you are passionate about software development, Artificial Intelligence, or innovation, Srujana is an opportunity to turn your ideas into meaningful solutions.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Details</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Date:</strong> 31 October 2026<br /><strong>Venue:</strong> Prabhavee Tech Park, Pune, Maharashtra <span data-teams=\"true\"><a id=\"menur4lp\" class=\"fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" title=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/stykmpjuhuxgevub8\" href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/StYkMPJUhUxGEvuB8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Link https://maps.app.goo.gl/StYkMPJUhUxGEvuB8\">https://maps.app.goo.gl/StYkMPJUhUxGEvuB8</a></span><br /><strong>Registration Time:</strong> 9:00 AM &ndash; 9:30 AM<br /><strong>Session Begins:</strong> 9:30 AM sharp</p>\n<p><span data-teams=\"true\">fill this google form&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-teams=\"true\"><a id=\"menur5cq\" class=\"fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn\" title=\"https://forms.gle/hpiwhdj8yafaeeq27\" href=\"https://forms.gle/HpiWHdj8YAfaeEQ27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" aria-label=\"Link https://forms.gle/HpiWHdj8YAfaeEQ27\">https://forms.gle/HpiWHdj8YAfaeEQ27</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Event Schedule</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>9:00 AM &ndash; 9:30 AM:</strong> Participant Registration</li>\n<li><strong>9:30 AM onwards:</strong> Introduction to Srujana</li>\n<li>Overview of Ethosh&rsquo;s Projects and Bio-Rad&rsquo;s AI Initiatives</li>\n<li>Introduction to Hackathon Problem Statements</li>\n<li>Explanation of Problem Statements and Judging Rubrics</li>\n<li>Ideation and Solution Development</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Further details regarding subsequent sessions and solution presentations will be communicated to participants by the organizing team.</p>\n<p><strong>What to Expect</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Insights into real-world industry challenges and AI initiatives.</li>\n<li>An introduction to problem statements and evaluation criteria.</li>\n<li>Opportunities to brainstorm, ideate, and develop innovative solutions.</li>\n<li>A collaborative environment that encourages creativity and technical thinking.</li>\n<li>Exposure to industry-oriented problem-solving approaches.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Important Instructions</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must arrive at the venue by <strong>9:00 AM</strong> to complete registration.</li>\n<li>Carry a valid <strong>Aadhaar Card and College ID Card</strong> for verification.</li>\n<li>Bringing a laptop is optional, but participants may carry one if they wish.</li>\n<li>Please arrive on time and follow the instructions provided by the organizing team.</li>\n</ul>",
